                                "sense_id": "73bfb256-855a-32fd-b03d-67cc0fa16259",
                                "text": "On the other hand, web-based institutions’ insistence that we all hold dozens of unguessable streams of letters and numbers in our heads, or else risk haemorrhaging cash and privacy, seems a heavy yoke for us to bear for those companies’ trading convenience."
